Z||000005||Monkeyman||07-31-2001||10:58 PM||||Los Angeles, CA.  Anyone with a trailer want to haul the Monkeymobile to LA for free?  I'm just trying to help a mate out and this would also help the notchback guys get their own Stage 2 kit sooner.  I used to have all kinds of contacts in the transportation business, but it's been too long since I've been behind the wheel of a big truck.  Any help would be appreciated.  I'd pay for shipping myself, but I just don't have the cash.  <P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
Z||000006||AusFiero||08-01-2001||01:03 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Simple Fiero:<BR><B>hey Aus, this maybe a stupid question, but what does momo have for fiero's (just curious) I thought they only deal in imports and newer compacts.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Mostly the steering wheels, gear knobs and pedals Simple. I have an engineering firm make adaptor plates to fit the steering wheels to a standard Fiero Boss Kit off any old GT wheel. A good example would be I have seem MOMO Commando steering wheels online for between $240 and $330 depending on the outlet. Then you have to buy a Boss Kit (hub adaptor, around $40 )and pay for shipping.  I sell them for $215 including shipping and insurance or $250 with an adaptor plate ready to just bolt onto a Fiero.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/S_P000395[1].jpg"> <BR>The Commando above is in Grinthocks car. He has had it a while. I just became a MOMO dealer days ago. He kindly donated this picture so people can see one in a Fiero. Various colours available. I have them in the mall for sale until I get <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>www.auto-alley.com</A>  back online.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
