Z||000008||AusFiero||08-01-2001||01:11 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Hartz:<BR><B>Hey Aus - what would shipping be on just a coupe nose?  Can we ship you a complete Fiero one body panel at a time?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  They all interchange - that's the beauty of these little things.  <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Good in theory Hartz but I do have to get another complete Fiero, otherwise mine will never be on the road. I kinda hate hacking it up at the moment when I have over 32 grand tied up in it. But I suppose I am doing it up more as I go. <P>Basically if my body kit sells well I will be pouring most of the money, bar living expenses (the families gotta eat) back into getting another Fiero project car for development purposes of future products. I will also need a full variety of different year model panels. I couldn't even begin to tell you some of the things I have planned. Would need a 50 page thread. <P>I am taking a huge risk financially at the moment to even do this part of the body kit so I hope it sells as well as it appears.<BR>||||reg||1
